# BOATLY — BUSINESS MODEL

**Version:** 1.0
**Status:** Approved business architecture — pricing hypotheses subject to validation
**Project:** Boatly
**Planning date:** August 2026

---

# 1. BUSINESS MODEL OBJECTIVE

Boatly combines two complementary businesses:

1. A B2C marketplace for boat rentals.
2. A B2B SaaS management platform for professional rental operators.

The commercial model must create alignment:

Boatly earns more when operators receive more valuable bookings.

At the same time, operators should be encouraged to use Boatly as their central fleet-management system even for reservations originating outside the Boatly marketplace.

