# 15. WHY USE MULTIPLE PLANS

The model creates three incentives.

## Small operator

No monthly risk.

Uses STARTER.

Pays Boatly only when Boatly generates marketplace revenue.

## Growing operator

Pays €49/month.

Receives better management tools and lower marketplace commission.

## Larger operator

Pays €99/month.

Receives advanced management capability and an even lower marketplace commission.

Therefore the operator can reduce commission by becoming a deeper Boatly customer.

