# 32. DISCOUNTS AND PROMOTIONS

Boatly may later create promotional codes.

Important distinction:

## Boatly-funded discount

Example:

Boat price:

€300

Boatly gives customer:

€20 promotional discount.

Operator should not automatically lose €20.

Boatly can fund the discount from its own commercial margin.

## Operator-funded discount

Operator intentionally reduces rental price.

The lower price becomes the commissionable rental value.

The funding source of every promotion must therefore be explicit.

